<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia confirms $937.89 mln Aug trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Indonesia confirms $937.89 mln Aug trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia posted a trade surplus of $937.89 million in August, compared with $508.5 million in July, Information Minister Harmoko said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Following are the trade figures for August, in millions of dollars, with comparisons for the previous month and a year earlier:</p>
<p>				August	  July    August 95</p>
<p>    Trade balance	+937.89	+508.5	 +148.5</p>
<p>    Exports	     4,317.17     4,066.4	3,940.3</p>
<p>    Imports	     3,379.28     3,557.9	3,791.8</p>
<p>    Oil/gas exports     971.49	 909.7	  862.0</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
